  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHR oPT Country  Programme 25 01</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OHCHR oPt works for all rights holders and victims of human rights violations, with particular attention to marginalised and vulnerable groups. The 2025 work plan is focused on :
1) Leading the Humanitarian Protection Response through activation of the Protection Cluster (OHCHR as lead);
2) Acting as monitoring and reporting Lead for UN data collection in the oPt;
3) Strengthening Rule of law &#x2013; Human Rights Implementation
4) Advancing Legal Harmonisation
5) Protecting civil Society Space;
6) Supporting Recovery &#x2013; human rights mainstreaming.</narrative>
  </description>
